      "text": "1. Getting feed data.     https , graphql, grpc, websocket, sse, long pooling etc.\n\nGET.   /api/v1/feed/?from=\"\"&size=\"\"\n\nReq Header: \nx-token: <>. -> for authentication. -> userId -> can authenticate with auth service. \n                can be sessionId or jwt token. -> userid, expiration,  secretkey -> jwt token. ,\n\nRes Header: \nx-trace-id <>",
